{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3c7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a811-e233-7700-9f73-d0f94294967e"},"sequence":62,"recorded_at":1780531400000119,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"d4ea5ec8-93af-4409-aa5b-edfe86e8078d","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"d4ea5ec8-93af-4409-aa5b-edfe86e8078d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"d4ea5ec8-93af-4409-aa5b-edfe86e8078d"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a812-1457-7a81-8805-1a010eda309b"},"task_id":"01a0a812-1457-7a81-8805-1a010eda309b","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a812-1457-7a81-8805-1a010eda309b","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-2-1\",\n  \"command\": \"ls -R .github Scripts Targets Packages 2>&1; echo ---; git diff --stat; echo ---; git diff -- RELEASING.md | head -n 200\",\n  \"description\": \"List release-related files and diff\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \".github:\\nworkflows\\n\\n.github/workflows:\\nci.yml\\nrelease.yml\\n\\nPackages:\\nRunnerControlCore\\n\\nPackages/RunnerControlCore:\\nPackage.resolved\\nPackage.swift\\nSources\\nTests\\n\\nPackages/RunnerControlCore/Sources:\\nCommandExecutor.swift\\nRunnerControlCore.swift\\nRunnerDiscovery.swift\\nRunnerRuntime.swift\\nRunners+Flow.swift\\nRunners+Models.swift\\nRunners+Module.swift\\nRunners+Service.swift\\nRunners+State+Reducer.swift\\nRunners+State.swift\\nRunners.swift\\n\\nPackages/RunnerControlCore/Tests:\\nRunnerControlCoreTests.swift\\nRunnerDiscoveryTests.swift\\n\\nScripts:\\n__pycache__\\nbuild.sh\\nrelease-preflight.sh\\nrelease.sh\\nrelease_metadata.py\\nsparkle-tools.sh\\ntests\\n\\nScripts/__pycache__:\\nrelease_metadata.cpython-311.pyc\\n\\nScripts/tests:\\n__pycache__\\ntest_release_metadata.py\\ntest_release_preflight.py\\n\\nScripts/tests/__pycache__:\\ntest_release_metadata.cpython-311.pyc\\ntest_release_preflight.cpython-311.pyc\\n\\nTargets:\\nRunnerControl\\n\\nTargets/RunnerControl:\\nResources\\nSources\\n\\nTargets/RunnerControl/Resources:\\nAssets.xcassets\\n\\nTargets/RunnerControl/Resources/Assets.xcassets:\\nAppIcon.appiconset\\nContents.json\\n\\nTargets/RunnerControl/Resources/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset:\\nContents.json\\nicon_128_1.png\\nicon_128_2.png\\nicon_16_1.png\\nicon_16_2.png\\nicon_256_1.png\\nicon_256_2.png\\nicon_32_1.png\\nicon_32_2.png\\nicon_512_1.png\\nicon_512_2.png\\n\\nTargets/RunnerControl/Sources:\\nApp.swift\\nAppRegistry.swift\\nAppUpdater.swift\\nRunnerCard.swift\\nRunnerContainer.swift\\nRunnerPage.swift\\n---\\n RELEASING.md                           | 31 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n Scripts/release-preflight.sh           | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++--\\n Scripts/release.sh                     |  2 +-\\n Scripts/release_metadata.py            | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n Scripts/tests/test_release_metadata.py | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n 5 files changed, 114 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)\\n---\\ndiff --git a/RELEASING.md b/RELEASING.md\\nindex f576e28..c5fdf5c 100644\\n--- a/RELEASING.md\\n+++ b/RELEASING.md\\n@@ -28,6 +28,37 @@ Each feed points to its immutable version-specific DMG URL. The application foll\\n \\n Build numbers are derived from the release workflow run number and attempt. Keep this workflow's run counter continuous; do not replace it with a new workflow whose counter starts over without adjusting the build-number scheme.\\n \\n+## Failure recovery\\n+\\n+Release run 35040921163 (`v1.1.0`) failed in Release prerequisites before any\\n+build or signing: the login keychain was locked in the runner session, so\\n+`notarytool` could not read profile `RunnerControl-notary` (`keychainLocked`).\\n+No draft or published release was created.\\n+\\n+To retry an existing tag, unlock the login keychain on macbook-iv with a\\n+console login as the runner user (no credentials are printed or exported),\\n+enable the runner in Runner Control, then run **Release DMG** via\\n+workflow_dispatch with the existing tag. Do not delete or re-push the tag and\\n+do not create the release by hand; the workflow refuses to overwrite published\\n+assets. If prerequisites still report a locked keychain, the runner session\\n+has no unlocked login keychain; unlock it and dispatch again.\\n+\\n+Preflight also fails fast when no Developer ID Application identity for team\\n+`262RZ595FP` is present, when several are present (remove the stale\\n+certificate so signing is unambiguous), when the notarytool profile is missing\\n+(recreate it with `xcrun notarytool store-credentials` as above), or when the\\n+Sparkle private key does not match `SUPublicEDKey`.\\n+\\n+Apple notarization waits up to 30 minutes per artifact (app ZIP, then DMG). If\\n+a wait times out, the submission ID in the release logs can be inspected with\\n+`xcrun notarytool info <id> --keychain-profile RunnerControl-notary` (status\\n+only); retrying dispatches a new run with a new monotonic build number. A\\n+pending signing-check submission is not a release artifact and does not block\\n+the next release.\\n+\\n+No new tag is created and nothing is published until product review and\\n+coordinator dispatch.\\n+\\n ## Validation status\\n \\n Core and release metadata tests pass locally and in GitHub Actions; the Sparkle-enabled app builds successfully. Developer ID signing and the notarytool profile are validated on macbook-iv. The complete notarization and update-install cycle requires the first accepted Apple submission and two published versions. Check GitHub Releases for publication status.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4354,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1089,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
