{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c995","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a811-e233-7700-9f73-d0f94294967e"},"sequence":805,"recorded_at":1780531400001605,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"d4ea5ec8-93af-4409-aa5b-edfe86e8078d","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"d4ea5ec8-93af-4409-aa5b-edfe86e8078d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"d4ea5ec8-93af-4409-aa5b-edfe86e8078d"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a815-9632-7481-95ff-b210eed9e188"},"task_id":"01a0a815-9632-7481-95ff-b210eed9e188","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a815-9632-7481-95ff-b210eed9e188","chunk":"Read text file `/tmp/attacks-rev1.log`.\n1|ATTACK 1: token-preserving retry-only signing bypass (attempt 2 uses ad-hoc identity)\n2|test_appcast_archive_binding (test_release_metadata.ReleaseMetadataTests.test_appcast_archive_binding) ... ok\n3|test_builds_increase_between_attempts_and_runs (test_release_metadata.ReleaseMetadataTests.test_builds_increase_between_attempts_and_runs) ... ok\n4|test_rejects_wrong_feed (test_release_metadata.ReleaseMetadataTests.test_rejects_wrong_feed) ... ok\n5|test_rejects_wrong_tag_or_identity (test_release_metadata.ReleaseMetadataTests.test_rejects_wrong_tag_or_identity) ... ok\n6|test_release_signs_dmg_with_resolved_team_identity (test_release_metadata.ReleaseWiringTests.test_release_signs_dmg_with_resolved_team_identity) ... ok\n7|test_rejects_apple_development_only (test_release_metadata.SigningIdentityTests.test_rejects_apple_development_only) ... ok\n8|test_rejects_missing_team_identity (test_release_metadata.SigningIdentityTests.test_rejects_missing_team_identity) ... ok\n9|test_rejects_multiple_team_identities (test_release_metadata.SigningIdentityTests.test_rejects_multiple_team_identities) ... ok\n10|test_rejects_near_match_team (test_release_metadata.SigningIdentityTests.test_rejects_near_match_team) ... ok\n11|test_returns_team_identity_ignoring_other_teams (test_release_metadata.SigningIdentityTests.test_returns_team_identity_ignoring_other_teams) ... ok\n12|test_locked_keychain_fails_with_unlock_guidance (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_locked_keychain_fails_with_unlock_guidance) ... ok\n13|test_missing_identity_rejected (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_missing_identity_rejected) ... ok\n14|test_missing_profile_names_profile_without_locked_guidance (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_missing_profile_names_profile_without_locked_guidance) ... ok\n15|test_multiple_team_identities_rejected (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_multiple_team_identities_rejected) ... ok\n16|test_preflight_passes_with_valid_credentials (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_preflight_passes_with_valid_credentials) ... ok\n17|test_sparkle_key_mismatch_rejected (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_sparkle_key_mismatch_rejected) ... ok\n18|\n19|----------------------------------------------------------------------\n20|Ran 16 tests in 2.923s\n21|\n22|OK\n23|\n24|suite exit: 0\n25|ATTACK 2: security failure with no output\n26|security: read failed\n27|Missing Developer ID Application identity with private key for team 262RZ595FP.\n28|An Account Holder must issue it; Apple Development or another team cannot be substituted.\n29|\n30|preflight exit: 1\n31|ATTACK 2: security failure with partial valid output\n32|Release prerequisites verified (team 262RZ595FP, notary profile 'RunnerControl-notary').\n33|security: read failed\n34|\n35|preflight exit: 0","final_result":true}}}
