ails_with_unlock_guidance (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_locked_keychain_fails_with_unlock_guidance) ... ok\n13|test_missing_identity_rejected (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_missing_identity_rejected) ... ok\n14|test_missing_profile_names_profile_without_locked_guidance (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_missing_profile_names_profile_without_locked_guidance) ... ok\n15|test_multiple_team_identities_rejected (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_multiple_team_identities_rejected) ... ok\n16|test_preflight_passes_with_valid_credentials (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_preflight_passes_with_valid_credentials) ... ok\n17|test_sparkle_key_mismatch_rejected (test_release_preflight.ReleasePreflightTests.test_sparkle_key_mismatch_rejected) ... ok\n18|\n19|----------------------------------------------------------------------\n20|Ran 16 tests in 2.923s\n21|\n22|OK\n23|\n24|suite exit: 0\n25|ATTACK 2: security failure with no output\n26|security: read failed\n27|Missing Developer ID Application identity with private key for team 262RZ595FP.\n28|An Account Holder must issue it; Apple Development or another team cannot be substituted.\n29|\n30|preflight exit: 1\n31|ATTACK 2: security failure with partial valid output\n32|Release prerequisites verified (team 262RZ595FP, notary profile 'RunnerControl-notary').\n33|security: read failed\n34|\n35|preflight exit: 0","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
