2/12 Swift core green (reused, untouched), 8/8 mutants killed including the reviewer's token-preserving retry mutant (M4 honestly classified as diagnostic, not admission). AC coverage 7 of 7 explicitly enumerated rows with production call sites. Full record in `TASK-260916-3uyl05_release-repair-evidence.md`. Candidate left uncommitted; no tags, releases, or runs dispatched; no runner touched.","reason":null}}
